/* The selection-only shell of Library.Process's host seam on the linux, macOS,
 * iOS and Android rows. `[[package.providers]]` needs one implementation per
 * row; these rows keep the POSIX bodies in Process.btrc, which C4 selects, so
 * this module declares nothing and adds nothing to their emitted C
 * (docs/design/windows-os-services.md, "Compiler-import impact"). */
